# Patch files must apply cleanly via `git apply` on the Linux CI runner that
# consumes them (.github/workflows/real-cashu-integration.yml's build-from-source
# step) — force LF regardless of this repo's own Windows dev-machine checkout
# behavior, so a local `git add`/checkout can never reintroduce CRLF and break
# the patch series. See patches/cdk/*.patch and DECISIONS.md's Phase 2 Step 5 entry.
patches/**/*.patch text eol=lf
